<title>SWITZERLAND: Sabena 1996 results due March 12.</title>
<headline>Sabena 1996 results due March 12.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian carrier Sabena will announce its 1996 results on Wednesday, March 12, a spokesman for Swissair AG said in response to inquiries.</p>
<p>Sabena, 49.5 percent owned by Swissair, had a 1995 group loss before provisions of 530 million Belgian francs and a two billion franc net loss in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>Sabena has said its budget also foresees a loss in 1997, but much smaller and by 1998 it should return to profitability.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
